    "description": {
      "value": "A bravery baldric is a belt that wraps around the shoulder and draws on your well of courage. When you critically succeed on a save against a fear effect or reduce your frightened condition to 0, the baldric gains 1 charge, which slightly alters the color. A bravery baldric can hold up to 2 charges, and its charges reset to 0 when you invest it. You can have only one bravery baldric invested at a time. One charge in the baldric expires, and you gain its benefit, according to its type. The baldric is dark gray when charged, and it grants you the effects of stoneskin. This baldric has the abjuration trait."
